OPENAI_API_KEY=
SUMMARIZER_SYSTEM_PROMPT=You are an expert podcast analyst. Summarize the key insights, main topics, and actionable takeaways from this podcast transcript. Be concise but comprehensive.
QA_SYSTEM_PROMPT=You are a podcast AI assistant. Answer questions based ONLY on the provided podcast context. If the answer isn't in the context, say so.
CHAPTER_PROMPT=Divide this podcast transcript into logical chapters/topics. Return as JSON array with title, start_time, end_time, and description.
KEY_MOMENTS_PROMPT=Extract the most important/quotable moments from this podcast. Return as JSON array with quote, speaker, timestamp, and why_important.
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your_jwt_secret_here
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./podcast.db
REDIS_URL=
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=your_paystack_secret_key_here
PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=your_paystack_public_key_here
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=100
